{"id":"n76125-1-8","stage":4,"title":"잔고 · 余额","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76125-1-8-1","ko":"내 통장에 얼마가 있는지 모르겠어.","zh":"我不知道我的银行卡里还有多少钱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"통장에","meaning":"存折","explanation":"통장：存折；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"통장","audio":"/audio/91c90fef5d58cec8c609.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71295","senseId":"1","lemma":"통장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통장에","audio":"/audio/a3efdff4cc4350cc4e4e.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마가","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마가","audio":"/audio/bd63c289102ec982e57b.mp3"}},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는지","audio":"/audio/7df109195b78bcf9f45d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来